{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":25,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":456,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1885025,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281241,"Name":"jencakes","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1422912440,"LastPoster":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1419972184","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":144,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1885379,"PostDate":1423145519,"PostContent":"I have tried to get in touch with Liz Moore Destination Wedding. I have not been able to get in t...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jbang27@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.55.35.79","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416861433,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jencakes","Id":281241,"Name":"jencakes","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.6.40","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78725,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"291a8157dd89ba574450ad212fe4c5b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement, jencakes and upcoming destination wedding!!! as you&#039;ve already seen, there are lots of great resources here to help with your planning process.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To inspire you further, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our incomparable Mayan Riviera....with more at this link: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10712556_10152866678259487_6850804250055839346_o.jpg\" alt=\"10712556_10152866678259487_6850804250055\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/p417x417\/1454681_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_n.jpg?oh=0673be0aeb5bc6366788705817f25b83&amp;amp;oe=556C408F&amp;amp;__gda__=1432683556_aaf43adfe1a592f76f4fedce0d6206c9\" alt=\"1454681_10153038436459487_82941670730249\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We wish you happy research and all the best with your journey - cheers!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885153,"PostDate":1423038376,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your engagement, jencakes and upcoming destination wedding!!! as you've already seen, there are lots of great resources here to help with your planning process.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To inspire you further, here are some magical wedding \"moments that matter\" Linc captured in our incomparable Mayan Riviera....with more at this link: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-h-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10712556_10152866678259487_6850804250055839346_o.jpg\" alt=\"10712556_10152866678259487_6850804250055\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpf1\/v\/t1.0-9\/p417x417\/1454681_10153038436459487_8294167073024966098_n.jpg?oh=0673be0aeb5bc6366788705817f25b83&oe=556C408F&__gda__=1432683556_aaf43adfe1a592f76f4fedce0d6206c9\" alt=\"1454681_10153038436459487_82941670730249\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>We wish you happy research and all the best with your journey - cheers!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.76.1.62","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78725,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84f7a01be5504a57e96073ee65cdb63a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have tried to get in touch with Liz Moore Destination Wedding. I have not been able to get in touch with them. No response via email and I can&#039;t reach them by phone. I hear Laurie Lee is recommended, but I went to her website and it seems like it hasn&#039;t been updated in two years. I was wondering if she is still doing DW. It is so frustrating! Does anyone have insight or can message me a travel agent in Canada? Thanks so much.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885379,"PostDate":1423145519,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have tried to get in touch with Liz Moore Destination Wedding. I have not been able to get in touch with them. No response via email and I can't reach them by phone. I hear Laurie Lee is recommended, but I went to her website and it seems like it hasn't been updated in two years. I was wondering if she is still doing DW. It is so frustrating! Does anyone have insight or can message me a travel agent in Canada? Thanks so much.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jbang27@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.55.35.79","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416861433,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jencakes","Id":281241,"Name":"jencakes","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78725,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2b1e2ed57d26054c41b6b7be6f62c46","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jencakes\" post=\"1885379\" timestamp=\"1423174319\"]\nI have tried to get in touch with Liz Moore Destination Wedding. I have not been able to get in touch with them. No response via email and I can&#039;t reach them by phone. I hear Laurie Lee is recommended, but I went to her website and it seems like it hasn&#039;t been updated in two years. I was wondering if she is still doing DW. It is so frustrating! Does anyone have insight or can message me a travel agent in Canada? Thanks so much.[\/quote]I&#039;ll PM you the lady we used. She was great. She is in Mexico till Sunday just as a heads up. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1885391,"PostDate":1423153451,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jencakes, on 05 February 2015 - 02:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I have tried to get in touch with Liz Moore Destination Wedding. I have not been able to get in touch with them. No response via email and I can't reach them by phone. I hear Laurie Lee is recommended, but I went to her website and it seems like it hasn't been updated in two years. I was wondering if she is still doing DW. It is so frustrating! Does anyone have insight or can message me a travel agent in Canada? Thanks so much.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI'll PM you the lady we used. She was great. She is in Mexico till Sunday just as a heads up. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78725,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c92fe39649fd3f081220ac17f1c9f87a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jencakes\" post=\"1885379\" timestamp=\"1423174319\"]\nI have tried to get in touch with Liz Moore Destination Wedding. I have not been able to get in touch with them. No response via email and I can&#039;t reach them by phone. I hear Laurie Lee is recommended, but I went to her website and it seems like it hasn&#039;t been updated in two years. I was wondering if she is still doing DW. It is so frustrating! Does anyone have insight or can message me a travel agent in Canada? Thanks so much.[\/quote]\nOh no, I&#039;m sorry they haven&#039;t gotten back to you. Did you send a generic inquiry or email Susan directly? I can email or call her if you like to contact you","Attachments":[],"Id":1885406,"PostDate":1423168705,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jencakes, on 05 February 2015 - 02:11 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I have tried to get in touch with Liz Moore Destination Wedding. I have not been able to get in touch with them. No response via email and I can't reach them by phone. I hear Laurie Lee is recommended, but I went to her website and it seems like it hasn't been updated in two years. I was wondering if she is still doing DW. It is so frustrating! Does anyone have insight or can message me a travel agent in Canada? Thanks so much.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nOh no, I'm sorry they haven't gotten back to you. Did you send a generic inquiry or email Susan directly? I can email or call her if you like to contact you\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410069785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.54.123.146","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78725,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c430096d7299476856fc2c044231ed6e","RawContent":"I had sent a generic email and called them multiple times but I couldn&#039;t get a hold of them and no response. I sent a direct email to them this afternoon, after I posted here. I received a response! Thank you all for your responses and help. I am so glad to have found this community. The amount of support and guidance is amazing.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885408,"PostDate":1423169086,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I had sent a generic email and called them multiple times but I couldn't get a hold of them and no response. I sent a direct email to them this afternoon, after I posted here. I received a response! Thank you all for your responses and help. I am so glad to have found this community. The amount of support and guidance is amazing. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jbang27@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.55.35.79","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1416861433,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jencakes","Id":281241,"Name":"jencakes","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78725,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57991a88ae423b2ede06e23d206abc28","RawContent":"@[member=\"jencakes\"] I&#039;m so glad they replied back to you :) I hope they take care of you and wish you all the best during your planning stage \n\n\nAnd yes, this forum is amazing!","Attachments":[],"Id":1885412,"PostDate":1423170813,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281241\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281241-jencakes\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jencakes<\/span><\/a> I'm so glad they replied back to you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I hope they take care of you and wish you all the best during your planning stage <br><br>\nAnd yes, this forum is amazing!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410069785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1420071985","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.89.56.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78725,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d66db4a2fbc0ec5781f694804df8cb90","RawContent":"Hi ladies, great info. I was wondering how long in advance do you send out the info to you guests about booking their vacation package? We will be getting married in Cancun in April 2016, so when should ppl start booking? \n\nThanks so much","Attachments":[],"Id":1885571,"PostDate":1423310701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies, great info. I was wondering how long in advance do you send out the info to you guests about booking their vacation package? We will be getting married in Cancun in April 2016, so when should ppl start booking? <br>\nThanks so much\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michele.a.ross@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.89.56.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423306259,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mimi2016","Id":282028,"Name":"Mimi2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78725,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6ae7e566583b5ebce456f3a5cbbc058","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Mimi2016\" post=\"1885571\" timestamp=\"1423339501\"]\nHi ladies, great info. I was wondering how long in advance do you send out the info to you guests about booking their vacation package? We will be getting married in Cancun in April 2016, so when should ppl start booking? \nThanks so much[\/quote]Depends. Did you get a group rate thru a travel agent or do you just hope people book alone?  If thru a travel agent, the airline dictates the deadlines. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1885572,"PostDate":1423311224,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Mimi2016, on Yesterday, 12:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Hi ladies, great info. I was wondering how long in advance do you send out the info to you guests about booking their vacation package? We will be getting married in Cancun in April 2016, so when should ppl start booking? <br>\nThanks so much<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nDepends. Did you get a group rate thru a travel agent or do you just hope people book alone?  If thru a travel agent, the airline dictates the deadlines. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78725,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7783759ad74cec26487a97f8cdee6c0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"HilaryMWren\" post=\"1885072\" timestamp=\"1422996701\"]\nHi\n\nI am also a newbie bride-to-be from Toronto seeking a Travel Agent. I have been working with one but find the process really overwhelming! Too many emails, prices, deadlines..... head spinning for sur!\n\nMy suggestion would be to narrow your resorts down to 1-2 places if possible. I was trying to find the \"cheapest\" 5 star resort within my time frame and it was not working. I am now going to worry less about the price (sorry guests!) and focus on finding a resort that does an excellent job at weddings.\n\nStill have not booked yet......\n\n@meandhim  - Thanks for the suggestions!\nOnce you have your date booked, did you send out save the dates with the travel agency info? How are you telling guests that they need to pay the deposit asap?\n\nThank you![\/quote]I know an AMAZING agent if you haven&#039;t found one yet. One of my girlfriends found her when she was looking for a TA for her Destination Wedding and she referred me to her after going through so many agents who weren&#039;t helpful.\nShe is super responsive, great prices and has been going above and beyond for anything i&#039;ve needed\/questions. If you haven&#039;t found one yet, let me know and I will give you her info :)\n\n@[member=\"HilaryMWren\"]","Attachments":[],"Id":1885584,"PostDate":1423317740,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>HilaryMWren, on 03 February 2015 - 12:51 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am also a newbie bride-to-be from Toronto seeking a Travel Agent. I have been working with one but find the process really overwhelming! Too many emails, prices, deadlines..... head spinning for sur!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My suggestion would be to narrow your resorts down to 1-2 places if possible. I was trying to find the \"cheapest\" 5 star resort within my time frame and it was not working. I am now going to worry less about the price (sorry guests!) and focus on finding a resort that does an excellent job at weddings.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Still have not booked yet......<\/p>\n<br><p>@meandhim\u00a0 - Thanks for the suggestions!<\/p>\n<p>Once you have your date booked, did you send out save the dates with the travel agency info? How are you telling guests that they need to pay the deposit asap?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I know an AMAZING agent if you haven't found one yet. One of my girlfriends found her when she was looking for a TA for her Destination Wedding and she referred me to her after going through so many agents who weren't helpful.<\/p>\n<p>She is super responsive, great prices and has been going above and beyond for anything i've needed\/questions. If you haven't found one yet, let me know and I will give you her info <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281741\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281741-hilarymwren\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">HilaryMWren<\/span><\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419409014,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1419972184","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":144,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.89.56.51","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78725,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5712749f2150cf312a9496f7df253e4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1885572\" timestamp=\"1423340024\"]\nDepends. Did you get a group rate thru a travel agent or do you just hope people book alone? If thru a travel agent, the airline dictates the deadlines.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nThanks for your reply! No, actually, we just decided this week that we will be getting married in Mexico, so I really haven&#039;t started planning. We&#039;re in Toronto, Ontario, but most of our guests will be coming from Montreal, so i would probably need to find a travel agent from there first.","Attachments":[],"Id":1885648,"PostDate":1423396700,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on Yesterday, 12:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Depends. Did you get a group rate thru a travel agent or do you just hope people book alone? If thru a travel agent, the airline dictates the deadlines.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for your reply! No, actually, we just decided this week that we will be getting married in Mexico, so I really haven't started planning. We're in Toronto, Ontario, but most of our guests will be coming from Montreal, so i would probably need to find a travel agent from there first.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"michele.a.ross@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.89.56.51","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423306259,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Mimi2016","Id":282028,"Name":"Mimi2016","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78725","Title":"Where To Start?! Canadian Bride Looking For Advice.","LastPostDate":1423409469},"Pages":{"TotalItems":25,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
