ding them out at that time. What are the rest of you doing?","Attachments":[],"Id":663214,"PostDate":1240342081,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here's another question- How and when are you distributing the bags to your guests? I'm having some trouble figuring out the best way. Right now I am leaning towards taking them to dinner the first night and handing them out at that time. What are the rest of you doing?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ticker.7910.org\/as1cHvR0g410000MTNsc3wxMDA5OTM4c3wxc3QgQW5uaXZlcnNhcnkgQ291bnRkb3duOg.gif\">http:\/\/www.ticker.7910.org\/as1cHvR0g...bnRkb3duOg.gif<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ticker.7910.org\/as1cHrl0g410020MzI4NzhifDE1MjM1YnxPdXIgYmFieSBib3kgYXJyaXZlcyBpbg.gif\">http:\/\/www.ticker.7910.org\/as1cHrl0g...aXZlcyBpbg.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"marybortz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1240252907,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216877.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bermuda11909","Id":216877,"Name":"bermuda11909","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f64e3ca0d781b94124233797c791514e","RawContent":"Im still up in the air. I&#039;ll either do them at dinner the first night or the cocktail party we&#039;re having on the second day.","Attachments":[],"Id":663323,"PostDate":1240346697,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Im still up in the air. I'll either do them at dinner the first night or the cocktail party we're having on the second day.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229818299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45833cd37ff857432c042f164127e9d8","RawContent":"I saw on a post that someone was going to ask the Stewards on the ship to hand them out but first going through the Pursers desk. It&#039;s an idea anyway, just thought I would put out that idea.","Attachments":[],"Id":663359,"PostDate":1240347648,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I saw on a post that someone was going to ask the Stewards on the ship to hand them out but first going through the Pursers desk. It's an idea anyway, just thought I would put out that idea.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingcountdown.com\"><br><\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/tv8lsq2245m94.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/tick...lsq2245m94.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kerbear99@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1239138618,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216556.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":97,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kerbear99","Id":216556,"Name":"kerbear99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13e715c0572dd6437efb8f1e8b71a128","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;kerbear99&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I saw on a post that someone was going to ask the Stewards on the ship to hand them out but first going through the Pursers desk. It&#039;s an idea anyway, just thought I would put out that idea.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I think I want to distribute my bags like this. I plan on calling carnival and asking them how I would go about doing this.","Attachments":[],"Id":673913,"PostDate":1241036516,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>kerbear99<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I saw on a post that someone was going to ask the Stewards on the ship to hand them out but first going through the Pursers desk. It's an idea anyway, just thought I would put out that idea.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I think I want to distribute my bags like this. I plan on calling carnival and asking them how I would go about doing this.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/locitaandgeorge\/\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/locitaandgeorge\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/w7hmA4B\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...A4B\/weight.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;128\/st\/20090922\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/86c7\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...86c7\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lowash67@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229785796,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213279.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lodixon","Id":213279,"Name":"lodixon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9547a8aa1b94325a96468354df4f4d3","RawContent":"I agree having the purser distribute them would prolly be my favorite idea. I asked my PVP ab it and she said that it should be doable but it&#039;s just based on whether or not the Purser&#039;s will feel like doing it. They basically would send them to the head of room stewards and he&#039;d give them to the appropriate room steward and they&#039;d put them in the rooms. I&#039;d just be worried that they may not make it.","Attachments":[],"Id":674067,"PostDate":1241044281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I agree having the purser distribute them would prolly be my favorite idea. I asked my PVP ab it and she said that it should be doable but it's just based on whether or not the Purser's will feel like doing it. They basically would send them to the head of room stewards and he'd give them to the appropriate room steward and they'd put them in the rooms. I'd just be worried that they may not make it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229818299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6ffe655abd59b98da14dccdcce4fd01f","RawContent":"I sent out my cruise gift bags about two weeks ago for my guests. My bags were beach bags that I purchased last year from Old Navy. Each bag had: a beach towel, room key holder, sunscreen, battery powered hand held fans, beach mat, and first aid kit with alka seltzer, band aids, sanitizer and motrin. We decided to go ahead and mail them to our guests ahead of time because we have no suitcase space to transport everything.","Attachments":[],"Id":674105,"PostDate":1241045081,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I sent out my cruise gift bags about two weeks ago for my guests. My bags were beach bags that I purchased last year from Old Navy. Each bag had: a beach towel, room key holder, sunscreen, battery powered hand held fans, beach mat, and first aid kit with alka seltzer, band aids, sanitizer and motrin. We decided to go ahead and mail them to our guests ahead of time because we have no suitcase space to transport everything.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"prttybrwneyes7@Hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1217457007,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210892.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cruisebride2009","Id":210892,"Name":"cruisebride2009","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"de475ce52502f884a1a005c2194f8e6f","RawContent":"Yay!!! My OTC Item just arrived. At like 8am lol i was still in bed. I just cleared off my table in my office and now im getting ready to go thru my items. I&#039;m soo excited lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":674448,"PostDate":1241084309,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yay!!! My OTC Item just arrived. At like 8am lol i was still in bed. I just cleared off my table in my office and now im getting ready to go thru my items. I'm soo excited lol.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229818299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":91,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
