Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a87a06827dede709e02f24dcff67fb04","RawContent":"OK now that I have opened the box im not as excited, I&#039;m actually disappointed. I ordered the hibiscus bags and they seem to be cheap (i mean clearly the price was cheap but I expected better quality, don&#039;t ask why lol) I will keep them tho. The material just isn&#039;t one that I think ppl would wanna use to carry around on the islands, oh well. I also ordered the Raffia fans which were fine. I hate the drawstring backpacks that I got for the guys and they are going back. I also don&#039;t like the coin purses I ordered but I may keep them. The flip flop stickies were smaller than I expected and I ordered alotta candies. The hibiscus lollipops were way smaller than they looked online. Oh well I&#039;m keeping all the candy.\n \n This weekend my project is the DIY Travel mugs which will mean alotta paper cutting n this really weird shape.","Attachments":[],"Id":674484,"PostDate":1241085402,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                OK now that I have opened the box im not as excited, I'm actually disappointed. I ordered the hibiscus bags and they seem to be cheap (i mean clearly the price was cheap but I expected better quality, don't ask why lol) I will keep them tho. The material just isn't one that I think ppl would wanna use to carry around on the islands, oh well. I also ordered the Raffia fans which were fine. I hate the drawstring backpacks that I got for the guys and they are going back. I also don't like the coin purses I ordered but I may keep them. The flip flop stickies were smaller than I expected and I ordered alotta candies. The hibiscus lollipops were way smaller than they looked online. Oh well I'm keeping all the candy.<br \/> <br \/> This weekend my project is the DIY Travel mugs which will mean alotta paper cutting n this really weird shape.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229818299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c7040b093dbfa7484e3924385bc2cbb3","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;kerbear99&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I saw on a post that someone was going to ask the Stewards on the ship to hand them out but first going through the Pursers desk. It&#039;s an idea anyway, just thought I would put out that idea.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;\n I&#039;m cruising Carnival so I&#039;m sure it depends on who you&#039;re sailing with...but I talked to them yesterday and they said I could either a) ship the bags ahead of time to them (through their specified shipping company) and then pay an additional fee to have them put in rooms, or b) bring bags on board and pay $1 a cabin to have them put in rooms. With option &amp;quot;b&amp;quot; they said the bags would be in the cabins around dinner time.\n \n I think I might just decide to give them out at dinner myself...","Attachments":[],"Id":675860,"PostDate":1241165623,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>kerbear99<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I saw on a post that someone was going to ask the Stewards on the ship to hand them out but first going through the Pursers desk. It's an idea anyway, just thought I would put out that idea.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div><br \/> I'm cruising Carnival so I'm sure it depends on who you're sailing with...but I talked to them yesterday and they said I could either a) ship the bags ahead of time to them (through their specified shipping company) and then pay an additional fee to have them put in rooms, or <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/cool.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='B)' \/> bring bags on board and pay $1 a cabin to have them put in rooms. With option \"b\" they said the bags would be in the cabins around dinner time.<br \/> <br \/> I think I might just decide to give them out at dinner myself...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimberht@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231959120,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213957.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":202,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"InspiredBride","Id":213957,"Name":"InspiredBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ad6e3ec84a63ed6ab8a7ce6e2293711","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Prettyhazardous&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;OK now that I have opened the box im not as excited, I&#039;m actually disappointed. I ordered the hibiscus bags and they seem to be cheap (i mean clearly the price was cheap but I expected better quality, don&#039;t ask why lol) I will keep them tho. The material just isn&#039;t one that I think ppl would wanna use to carry around on the islands, oh well .&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I got the hibisucus bags too, and I do agree that they aren&#039;t the best quality. However, I think for the price (you really can&#039;t beat it) they&#039;re cute and will at least be good for using as a &amp;quot;pool bag.&amp;quot; Plus, I&#039;ve read on other posts that a lot of people ended up regretting spending a lot on the nicer bags since people didn&#039;t use them anyway. So I think overall they&#039;ll be great and your guests will appreciate them! :)\n \n My big problem now is that they are kind of big so they seem really empty. I need some large but cheap items to add!","Attachments":[],"Id":675867,"PostDate":1241165910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Prettyhazardous<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">OK now that I have opened the box im not as excited, I'm actually disappointed. I ordered the hibiscus bags and they seem to be cheap (i mean clearly the price was cheap but I expected better quality, don't ask why lol) I will keep them tho. The material just isn't one that I think ppl would wanna use to carry around on the islands, oh well .<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I got the hibisucus bags too, and I do agree that they aren't the best quality. However, I think for the price (you really can't beat it) they're cute and will at least be good for using as a \"pool bag.\" Plus, I've read on other posts that a lot of people ended up regretting spending a lot on the nicer bags since people didn't use them anyway. So I think overall they'll be great and your guests will appreciate them! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> <br \/> My big problem now is that they are kind of big so they seem really empty. I need some large but cheap items to add!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimberht@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1231959120,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213957.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":202,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"InspiredBride","Id":213957,"Name":"InspiredBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ea693a0a18eacd70c30a113ca66b1818","RawContent":"LOL Kimber\n I looked at that some more and I agree I will def keep them, there are a better quality than paper gift bags so lol. It&#039;ll work. I&#039;d also purchased the drawstring bags for the guys and they ended up being kid sized bags so they def have to go back. I found a guy on ebay the buy the drawstring bags but they were soo much more expensive. But al least I&#039;m sure that the guys will get alotta use out of them.","Attachments":[],"Id":677106,"PostDate":1241252520,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                LOL Kimber<br \/> I looked at that some more and I agree I will def keep them, there are a better quality than paper gift bags so lol. It'll work. I'd also purchased the drawstring bags for the guys and they ended up being kid sized bags so they def have to go back. I found a guy on ebay the buy the drawstring bags but they were soo much more expensive. But al least I'm sure that the guys will get alotta use out of them.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229818299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70b4c364e9a70a3ef53be8e04304dda3","RawContent":"I decided to also give mine to the purser and let him distribute them. I also called the hotel where we will be staying and they stated that we can send my OOT items prior to arriving in Miami. I thought that was cool so I don&#039;t have to take all that stuff with me on the plane.. Some of you may want to call the hotel and see if they will do the same.","Attachments":[],"Id":679385,"PostDate":1241464442,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I decided to also give mine to the purser and let him distribute them. I also called the hotel where we will be staying and they stated that we can send my OOT items prior to arriving in Miami. I thought that was cool so I don't have to take all that stuff with me on the plane.. Some of you may want to call the hotel and see if they will do the same.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/locitaandgeorge\/\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/locitaandgeorge\/<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/w7hmA4B\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...A4B\/weight.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;128\/st\/20090922\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/86c7\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...86c7\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lowash67@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1229785796,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213279.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":75,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lodixon","Id":213279,"Name":"lodixon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cbb7c422db1e9bc783056a1bfe0410fd","RawContent":"Just wanted to give you guys a heads up. OTC is great with returns. I needed to return an item that was $20 they just refunded me the $$ and told me to donate the items to charity. I plan to give them to my church&#039;s summer camp program. They were DIY canvas backpacks, that I was gonna use for the men&#039;s OOT bags. I thought they were for adults but turns out they were for kids. So hopefully the summer camp kids will have fun with them.","Attachments":[],"Id":681569,"PostDate":1241605603,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just wanted to give you guys a heads up. OTC is great with returns. I needed to return an item that was $20 they just refunded me the $$ and told me to donate the items to charity. I plan to give them to my church's summer camp program. They were DIY canvas backpacks, that I was gonna use for the men's OOT bags. I thought they were for adults but turns out they were for kids. So hopefully the summer camp kids will have fun with them.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229818299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16cf5eadc95a957a2ce780c52a32bd0c","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Prettyhazardous&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Just wanted to give you guys a heads up. OTC is great with returns. I needed to return an item that was $20 they just refunded me the $$ and told me to donate the items to charity. I plan to give them to my church&#039;s summer camp program. They were DIY canvas backpacks, that I was gonna use for the men&#039;s OOT bags. I thought they were for adults but turns out they were for kids. So hopefully the summer camp kids will have fun with them.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;That is way cool!! Everything I&#039;ve ordered from there has been decent.\n \n And we&#039;re handing our bags out in the limo on the way to port. I had everything packed, then I realized I&#039;d rather be drinking then putting bags together!!","Attachments":[],"Id":682165,"PostDate":1241626522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Prettyhazardous<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Just wanted to give you guys a heads up. OTC is great with returns. I needed to return an item that was $20 they just refunded me the $$ and told me to donate the items to charity. I plan to give them to my church's summer camp program. They were DIY canvas backpacks, that I was gonna use for the men's OOT bags. I thought they were for adults but turns out they were for kids. So hopefully the summer camp kids will have fun with them.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>That is way cool!! Everything I've ordered from there has been decent.<br \/> <br \/> And we're handing our bags out in the limo on the way to port. I had everything packed, then I realized I'd rather be drinking then putting bags together!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong><i>~Kathy~<\/i><\/strong><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1267\/106\/20090511\/Since+we+said+I+DO%21\/ticker.png\">http:\/\/www.ezticker.com\/ticker\/1267\/...%21\/ticker.png<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i84.photobucket.com\/albums\/k1\/Cattiebri13\/05_5-1-1.jpg\">http:\/\/i84.photobucket.com\/albums\/k1...3\/05_5-1-1.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"KCarder3@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1214673067,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210208.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cattie","Id":210208,"Name":"Cattie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"096fe9e19df3d60b95730155e0fe7610","RawContent":"That is so nice of OTC, I&#039;m sure the campers will enjoy them!","Attachments":[],"Id":682468,"PostDate":1241645200,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                That is so nice of OTC, I'm sure the campers will enjoy them!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i348.photobucket.com\/albums\/q351\/merocket59\/logo4small.png\">http:\/\/i348.photobucket.com\/albums\/q...logo4small.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"merocket59@aol.com","IpAddress":"75.69.58.113","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1211560056,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209559.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"merocket59","Id":209559,"Name":"merocket59","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e5828240c214098762ffd36617f9641","RawContent":"I just ordered my bags, they should be here Sat. We decided not to spend a lot on the bags so that we can add more items to them. I ordered the reusable shopper bags. I figure maybe people will actually use them for groceries and such. I have a few and use them all the time. They cost less than $1 each. I ordered more than I need but I know I will use them as gift bags or stocking stuffer&#039;s at Christmas.","Attachments":[],"Id":698494,"PostDate":1242888751,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just ordered my bags, they should be here Sat. We decided not to spend a lot on the bags so that we can add more items to them. I ordered the reusable shopper bags. I figure maybe people will actually use them for groceries and such. I have a few and use them all the time. They cost less than $1 each. I ordered more than I need but I know I will use them as gift bags or stocking stuffer's at Christmas.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/O4RFm5\/.png\">http:\/\/dw.daisypath.com\/O4RFm5\/.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"KimC2323@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1241826048,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217392.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"setsail09","Id":217392,"Name":"setsail09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"81ae080ffcb8e23627b0e10575ed5065","RawContent":"So far, my OOT Bags will contain the following:\n \n Beach Bag\n Beach Towels \n Personalized Travel Tumblers\n Flip Flop Playing Cards\n Hand Sanitizer\n Flip Flop Luggage Tags\n Starfish Wine Stopper\n Card Holders with Lanyards\n Disposable Cameras\n \n I&#039;m also considering adding:\n \n Sunscreen\n Lip Balm\n Puzzle Books\n Bottle of Wine","Attachments":[],"Id":715203,"PostDate":1244389521,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So far, my OOT Bags will contain the following:<br \/> <br \/> Beach Bag<br \/> Beach Towels <br \/> Personalized Travel Tumblers<br \/> Flip Flop Playing Cards<br \/> Hand Sanitizer<br \/> Flip Flop Luggage Tags<br \/> Starfish Wine Stopper<br \/> Card Holders with Lanyards<br \/> Disposable Cameras<br \/> <br \/> I'm also considering adding:<br \/> <br \/> Sunscreen<br \/> Lip Balm<br \/> Puzzle Books<br \/> Bottle of Wine\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100112\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/1\/k\/5bdb\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...5bdb\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kerripuckrin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1244304004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218189.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":145,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kpuckrin","Id":218189,"Name":"kpuckrin","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":91,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
