{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"499f053ee07194267fdfc7b412d25404","RawContent":"So I talked to my PVP yesterday and since we&#039;re not actually getting married on the cruise ship Carnival won&#039;t put my OOT Bags in the guests rooms. So my PVP suggested that I sit in the lobby during embarkation and hand them out... What do you guys think&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":722542,"PostDate":1244915336,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So I talked to my PVP yesterday and since we're not actually getting married on the cruise ship Carnival won't put my OOT Bags in the guests rooms. So my PVP suggested that I sit in the lobby during embarkation and hand them out... What do you guys think<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Huh\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229818299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79bf6b59008084e932a17531643fd269","RawContent":"Boarding the ship is a little hectic- waiting for luggage, trying to find your way around, etc. I would suggest bringing them to dinner on the first night.","Attachments":[],"Id":722555,"PostDate":1244916438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Boarding the ship is a little hectic- waiting for luggage, trying to find your way around, etc. I would suggest bringing them to dinner on the first night.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100112\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/1\/k\/5bdb\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...5bdb\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kerripuckrin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1244304004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218189.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":145,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kpuckrin","Id":218189,"Name":"kpuckrin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"588d2ce88b2d1da7c1a5de78742d62d5","RawContent":"I have decided to handout my OOT bags during embarkation. Since we are doing a group check-in, I have my sisters and maid of honor handing out the OOT bags. I was able to get a great deal on the bags at Bijoux Terner, they were 50 percent off! I am giving on OOT bag per cabin. Since we are only gong on a weekend cruise, we have decided to place the following items in the OOT bags:\n \n &#8226;Disposable Cameras (beach wedding theme)\n &#8226;Beach Towel\n &#8226;Wedding T-Shirt\n &#8226;Itinerary \n &#8226;Gift from Bride and Groom: picture frame \n &#8226;Beach ball\n &#8226;Frisbee\n &#8226;Lip balm\n &#8226;Visors\n \n Also at the ceremony we are placing parasols on the chairs so guest can cover themselves from the sun. \n \n I might add on some additional items to the bag&#8230;however I have to stay within budget! LOL","Attachments":[],"Id":722774,"PostDate":1244943697,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have decided to handout my OOT bags during embarkation. Since we are doing a group check-in, I have my sisters and maid of honor handing out the OOT bags. I was able to get a great deal on the bags at Bijoux Terner, they were 50 percent off! I am giving on OOT bag per cabin. Since we are only gong on a weekend cruise, we have decided to place the following items in the OOT bags:<br \/> <br \/> &#8226;Disposable Cameras (beach wedding theme)<br \/> &#8226;Beach Towel<br \/> &#8226;Wedding T-Shirt<br \/> &#8226;Itinerary <br \/> &#8226;Gift from Bride and Groom: picture frame <br \/> &#8226;Beach ball<br \/> &#8226;Frisbee<br \/> &#8226;Lip balm<br \/> &#8226;Visors<br \/> <br \/> Also at the ceremony we are placing parasols on the chairs so guest can cover themselves from the sun. <br \/> <br \/> I might add on some additional items to the bag&#8230;however I have to stay within budget! LOL\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rive1641@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1241315376,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217240.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ceci21","Id":217240,"Name":"Ceci21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ad1d62d0431303f2bed2627fa5b78051","RawContent":"I am so mad that OTC doesn&#039;t have those palm tree pens anymore. I&#039;m also not doing the first aid kits anymore either. My bags are just ab done now, and I&#039;ll be like $200 under budget...","Attachments":[],"Id":722844,"PostDate":1244974308,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am so mad that OTC doesn't have those palm tree pens anymore. I'm also not doing the first aid kits anymore either. My bags are just ab done now, and I'll be like $200 under budget...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229818299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"102191267de8c0f6809d3facd8a6403e","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Prettyhazardous&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I am so mad that OTC doesn&#039;t have those palm tree pens anymore. I&#039;m also not doing the first aid kits anymore either. My bags are just ab done now, and I&#039;ll be like $200 under budget...&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Me too! I am doing a Palm Tree theme and these pens would have been perfect. I am going to keep looking and see if I can find anything comparable. However, I did find really nice (and cheap!) palm tree bottle opener key chains on ebay which I bought for the bags. Here is the link:\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/cgi.ebay.com\/Pack-of-6-Aluminiu-Palm-Tree-Bottle-Opener-Key-Rings_W0QQitemZ250443605430QQcmdZViewItemQQimsxZ20090613?IMSfp=TL090613235002r879\"&gt;Pack of 6 Aluminiu Palm Tree Bottle Opener Key Rings - eBay (item 250443605430 end time Jun-19-09 20:26:08 PDT)&lt;\/a&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":724462,"PostDate":1245092380,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Prettyhazardous<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I am so mad that OTC doesn't have those palm tree pens anymore. I'm also not doing the first aid kits anymore either. My bags are just ab done now, and I'll be like $200 under budget...<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Me too! I am doing a Palm Tree theme and these pens would have been perfect. I am going to keep looking and see if I can find anything comparable. However, I did find really nice (and cheap!) palm tree bottle opener key chains on ebay which I bought for the bags. Here is the link:<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/cgi.ebay.com\/Pack-of-6-Aluminiu-Palm-Tree-Bottle-Opener-Key-Rings_W0QQitemZ250443605430QQcmdZViewItemQQimsxZ20090613?IMSfp=TL090613235002r879' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Pack of 6 Aluminiu Palm Tree Bottle Opener Key Rings - eBay (item 250443605430 end time Jun-19-09 20:26:08 PDT)<\/a>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ticker.7910.org\/as1cHvR0g410000MTNsc3wxMDA5OTM4c3wxc3QgQW5uaXZlcnNhcnkgQ291bnRkb3duOg.gif\">http:\/\/www.ticker.7910.org\/as1cHvR0g...bnRkb3duOg.gif<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.ticker.7910.org\/as1cHrl0g410020MzI4NzhifDE1MjM1YnxPdXIgYmFieSBib3kgYXJyaXZlcyBpbg.gif\">http:\/\/www.ticker.7910.org\/as1cHrl0g...aXZlcyBpbg.gif<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"marybortz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1240252907,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216877.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bermuda11909","Id":216877,"Name":"bermuda11909","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5a77a64bf7da8cc36ac4c5e2155aa55","RawContent":"45 of our 50 guests will be meeting us for a Welcome\/Rehearsal dinner the night before the cruise so we are handing out our bags then. We just got the plain canvas bags from cheaptotes.com and sewed pockets onto the front with our logo.\n \n In the front pocket\n - Welcome Brochure (Vista)\n - Photoshare card (Vista)\n - Addressed and stamped Postcard (Vista)\n \n Our OOT bags have:\n - First-aid kit\n - Duct tape (with story for it)\n - Gum\n - Mints\n - Lifesavers\n - sticky pads\n - highlighter and pens\n - fun, goofy sunglasses\n - deck of cards (pirates)\n - Anti-bac gel (coconut lime scent)\n - Beach theme soap\n - Aloe Vera\n - Personalized Hot Sauce\n - Disposable camera (wedding party bags only)\n - Personalized T-shirt (wedding party bags only)\n - I think thats all??\n \n We are also sliding Thank you notes under their doors the last night of the cruise (again Vista). We will be sending formal thank yous later, as well.","Attachments":[],"Id":736658,"PostDate":1245875948,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                45 of our 50 guests will be meeting us for a Welcome\/Rehearsal dinner the night before the cruise so we are handing out our bags then. We just got the plain canvas bags from cheaptotes.com and sewed pockets onto the front with our logo.<br \/> <br \/> In the front pocket<br \/> - Welcome Brochure (Vista)<br \/> - Photoshare card (Vista)<br \/> - Addressed and stamped Postcard (Vista)<br \/> <br \/> Our OOT bags have:<br \/> - First-aid kit<br \/> - Duct tape (with story for it)<br \/> - Gum<br \/> - Mints<br \/> - Lifesavers<br \/> - sticky pads<br \/> - highlighter and pens<br \/> - fun, goofy sunglasses<br \/> - deck of cards (pirates)<br \/> - Anti-bac gel (coconut lime scent)<br \/> - Beach theme soap<br \/> - Aloe Vera<br \/> - Personalized Hot Sauce<br \/> - Disposable camera (wedding party bags only)<br \/> - Personalized T-shirt (wedding party bags only)<br \/> - I think thats all??<br \/> <br \/> We are also sliding Thank you notes under their doors the last night of the cruise (again Vista). We will be sending formal thank yous later, as well.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t45375\">My Planning Thread<\/a><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/scottandcarla\">Our Wedding Website<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"carlitarenee@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1229572858,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213246.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":67,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Carlitarenee","Id":213246,"Name":"Carlitarenee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a89d27627048d6706f5aac9e0098316","RawContent":"Sounds good carla","Attachments":[],"Id":736664,"PostDate":1245876178,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sounds good carla\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229818299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c5ddb708e0012e09373aefd7bca344d","RawContent":"Here is the list of things going in my bag...\n room scent\n first aid kits\n OTC meds\n sunscreen\n jelly beans\/treats\n bug spray\n puzzle book\/soduko\/etc\n power strip\n highlighter\n zip lock bags\n nightlight\/travel clock\n hangers \n clips to keep curtains closed\n plastic card holder \/ lanyard\n walkie talkies\n door hanger (white board?)","Attachments":[],"Id":745370,"PostDate":1246487691,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Here is the list of things going in my bag...<br \/> room scent<br \/> first aid kits<br \/> OTC meds<br \/> sunscreen<br \/> jelly beans\/treats<br \/> bug spray<br \/> puzzle book\/soduko\/etc<br \/> power strip<br \/> highlighter<br \/> zip lock bags<br \/> nightlight\/travel clock<br \/> hangers <br \/> clips to keep curtains closed<br \/> plastic card holder \/ lanyard<br \/> walkie talkies<br \/> door hanger (white board?)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;116\/st\/20100101\/e\/our+wedding%21%21%21\/k\/aee0\/event.png\">http:\/\/