{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f6b4f6948b7d333d350d5d320d76713","RawContent":"Does anyone know if carnival lets you have candles in the rooms? I want to put a scented candle in each bag, but won&#039;t if they can&#039;t be lit.","Attachments":[],"Id":768242,"PostDate":1248126435,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Does anyone know if carnival lets you have candles in the rooms? I want to put a scented candle in each bag, but won't if they can't be lit.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;116\/st\/20100101\/e\/our+wedding%21%21%21\/k\/aee0\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...aee0\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lindsay.sarah.kane@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1234204750,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-214762.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"xcandilkx","Id":214762,"Name":"xcandilkx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e17872ca20fba29b7ee3345609b49029","RawContent":"NO NO NO you def cannot have candles on carnival ship. They will set off the smoke detectors which will turn on the showers and ruin all of your stuff as well as your neighbors... I was thinking about putting in a flameless candle or a plug in of some sort. I am such a candle person and it annoys me that I will have no candles for my weddingmoon lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":768309,"PostDate":1248129700,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                NO NO NO you def cannot have candles on carnival ship. They will set off the smoke detectors which will turn on the showers and ruin all of your stuff as well as your neighbors... I was thinking about putting in a flameless candle or a plug in of some sort. I am such a candle person and it annoys me that I will have no candles for my weddingmoon lol.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><i><strong>Be Blessed,<br>Mrs. Willis<br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com\">MrandMrsWillis.shutterfly.com<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09\">http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/ashleyandbrian09<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/zz72\/Prettyhazardous\/087WillisWedding.jpg\">http:\/\/i815.photobucket.com\/albums\/z...lisWedding.jpg<\/a><\/strong><\/i><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleyfleming05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1229818299,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-213287.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":96,"PhotoHeight":63,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Prettyhazardous","Id":213287,"Name":"Prettyhazardous","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9fee94144ff43e04aa2333d7b136db0d","RawContent":"I understand what an OOT bag is, but I don&#039;t know what it means. Does OOT stand for something?","Attachments":[],"Id":781932,"PostDate":1248961490,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I understand what an OOT bag is, but I don't know what it means. Does OOT stand for something?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Beaches Negril, 9\/24\/2011.<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mrandmrsstamper@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248267241,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219706.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Trimalusta","Id":219706,"Name":"Trimalusta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d815de480512d33aa2f8263f3895d0e3","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Trimalusta&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I understand what an OOT bag is, but I don&#039;t know what it means. Does OOT stand for something?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;OOT stands for Out Of Town. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":782377,"PostDate":1248978532,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Trimalusta<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I understand what an OOT bag is, but I don't know what it means. Does OOT stand for something?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>OOT stands for Out Of Town. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100112\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/1\/k\/5bdb\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...5bdb\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"kerripuckrin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1244304004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218189.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":145,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kpuckrin","Id":218189,"Name":"kpuckrin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d209fa69e39deca282feddb078752ae8","RawContent":"Thanks Kpuckrin! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":786351,"PostDate":1249317896,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks Kpuckrin! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Beaches Negril, 9\/24\/2011.<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"mrandmrsstamper@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248267241,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219706.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Trimalusta","Id":219706,"Name":"Trimalusta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3e235d124fef06fbeb39496c9449825","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey ladies...I&#039;m a bride to be on the Carnival Conquest April 2012...What the heck is a OOT bag?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1438890,"PostDate":1303400193,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey ladies...I'm a bride to be on the Carnival Conquest April 2012...What the heck is a OOT bag?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shelley7711@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1303398803,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239127.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shelley771","Id":239127,"Name":"shelley771","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fd991b4397590cc56c60c350a1540de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m a bride to be on the Carnival Dream in April 2012.. if you scrolled up 2 posts before you&#039;d see an OOT bag stands for an Out-Of-Town bag.. and it&#039;s something (not mandatory or anything by any means) that the bride and groom have for their guests who are travelling in from out of town to join them for their wedding. They can be as simple as a welcome note, some postcards and a small bag of snacks, or as elaborate as including personalized travel mugs, beach towels, and all manners of souveniers and first aid kits, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1439822,"PostDate":1303566571,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm a bride to be on the Carnival Dream in April 2012.. if you scrolled up 2 posts before you'd see an OOT bag stands for an Out-Of-Town bag.. and it's something (not mandatory or anything by any means) that the bride and groom have for their guests who are travelling in from out of town to join them for their wedding. They can be as simple as a welcome note, some postcards and a small bag of snacks, or as elaborate as including personalized travel mugs, beach towels, and all manners of souveniers and first aid kits, etc.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>~Married aboard the cruise ship the <\/span><strong>'Carnival Dream'<\/strong><span>~<\/span><br><span>~Carnival Dream Wedding April 28th, 2012, then set sail on a 7 night Caribbean Cruise April 28th-May 5th, 2012~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"symbol_J@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1301233815,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238250.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":154,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DramaticAnnie","Id":238250,"Name":"DramaticAnnie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b80cb494cd4eaac42c2adac19b371d2f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve been thinking about this and I think I&#039;m going to distribute them before we leave since cruise ship says they will not deliver to each room.&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t think of carrying all this stuff with everything else i need to carry&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1451676,"PostDate":1305323533,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've been thinking about this and I think I'm going to distribute them before we leave since cruise ship says they will not deliver to each room.\u00a0 I can't think of carrying all this stuff with everything else i need to carry<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"evianca@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1302980791,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238946.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Barkles","Id":238946,"Name":"Barkles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"29ac21c3bbc654f4c9a8ec170b452df8","RawContent":"Which cruise line are you sailing with barkles?\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Barkles[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;ve been thinking about this and I think I&#039;m going to distribute them before we leave since cruise ship says they will not deliver to each room.  I can&#039;t think of carrying all this stuff with everything else i need to carry[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1451793,"PostDate":1305368620,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Which cruise line are you sailing with barkles?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Barkles<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I've been thinking about this and I think I'm going to distribute them before we leave since cruise ship says they will not deliver to each room.\u00a0 I can't think of carrying all this stuff with everything else i need to carry<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>~Married aboard the cruise ship the <\/span><strong>'Carnival Dream'<\/strong><span>~<\/span><br><span>~Carnival Dream Wedding April 28th, 2012, then set sail on a 7 night Caribbean Cruise April 28th-May 5th, 2012~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"symbol_J@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1301233815,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238250.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":154,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DramaticAnnie","Id":238250,"Name":"DramaticAnnie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac09c7f9de8ceec7b0f91196f3cf65ea","RawContent":"Barkles, we mailed pre cruise care packages to guests a few weeks before departure. I didn&#039;t want to mess with getting the stuff on board. Worked great and they were excited to get them! Sent from my T-Mobile G2 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1452037,"PostDate":1305456911,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Barkles, we mailed pre cruise care packages to guests a few weeks before departure. I didn't want to mess with getting the stuff on board. Worked great and they were excited to get them! Sent from my T-Mobile G2 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andreajphillips@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.56.10.56","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1213791420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210029.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":142,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~Andrea~","Id":210029,"Name":"~Andrea~","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":91,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
