{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bde5569d0696b5d50f0478e15a3aec3b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I had NO idea what an OOT bags was before reading these boards but I had ordered stuff to make bags for the sailing and non sailing guests a long time ago just a small way to say TY for joining us. It isn&#039;t much but it&#039;s a little something and we are also having a small fruit bsket sent to each cabin from Carnival we only have 9 \"cabins\" in total and figured whoever was in the cabin could share the fruit. We got all our \"OOT\" stuff from OTC the bags are just gift bag material so disposable but say Welcome to our Wedding on them which I tought was cute and they contain:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Two Hearts Wedding \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Love Notes\u00e2\u20ac\u009d Notepads&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; WEDDING MESSAGE PENS&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; TWO HEARTS ONE LOVE FACIAL TISSUE PACKS&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; LOVE BUBBLE MAGNET FAVOR&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; MINI CHOCOLATE WEDDING STICKER (For Hershey Hugs and Kisses) The labels read \"To Have and To Hold\", \"Happily Ever After\", \"Best Wishes\", \"A Wonderful Day\", \"Love Is Forever\" and \"Congratulations\"&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; WEDDING LOTTERY TICKET HOLDER FAVOR (Going to put 2 scratch off tickets in each)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; MINIATURE WEDDING CANDY WRAPPERS (Hershey Minitures)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \"LOVE\" PLAYING CARDS&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; WEDDING FORTUNE COOKIES (50PC) Also ordered a small take out type box to put 2 cookies in for each guest&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; TUX &amp;amp; GOWN WEDDING BUTTERMINTS&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; WEDDING SWIRL POPS (Personilized Free)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; PERSONALIZED WEDDING BOTTLE STICKERS (Putting on water bottles and putting 2 per bag) (Personilized Free)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; PERSONALIZE WEDDING COOKIE CUTTER W\/CARD (Personilized Free)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We spent 150.00 for stuff to make 24 Bags. We are also&amp;nbsp;doing is ordering lanyards for each sailing guest. OTC has Plain white ones and we are going to write on them the ship name and date.&lt;span style=\"display: none\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1465935,"PostDate":1307567510,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I had NO idea what an OOT bags was before reading these boards but I had ordered stuff to make bags for the sailing and non sailing guests a long time ago just a small way to say TY for joining us. It isn't much but it's a little something and we are also having a small fruit bsket sent to each cabin from Carnival we only have 9 \"cabins\" in total and figured whoever was in the cabin could share the fruit. We got all our \"OOT\" stuff from OTC the bags are just gift bag material so disposable but say Welcome to our Wedding on them which I tought was cute and they contain:<\/p> <p> Two Hearts Wedding \u00e2\u20ac\u0153Love Notes\u00e2\u20ac\u009d Notepads<\/p> <p> WEDDING MESSAGE PENS<\/p> <p> TWO HEARTS ONE LOVE FACIAL TISSUE PACKS<\/p> <p> LOVE BUBBLE MAGNET FAVOR<\/p> <p> MINI CHOCOLATE WEDDING STICKER (For Hershey Hugs and Kisses) The labels read \"To Have and To Hold\", \"Happily Ever After\", \"Best Wishes\", \"A Wonderful Day\", \"Love Is Forever\" and \"Congratulations\"<\/p> <p> WEDDING LOTTERY TICKET HOLDER FAVOR (Going to put 2 scratch off tickets in each)<\/p> <p> MINIATURE WEDDING CANDY WRAPPERS (Hershey Minitures)<\/p> <p> \"LOVE\" PLAYING CARDS<\/p> <p> WEDDING FORTUNE COOKIES (50PC) Also ordered a small take out type box to put 2 cookies in for each guest<\/p> <p> TUX & GOWN WEDDING BUTTERMINTS<\/p> <p> WEDDING SWIRL POPS (Personilized Free)<\/p> <p> PERSONALIZED WEDDING BOTTLE STICKERS (Putting on water bottles and putting 2 per bag) (Personilized Free)<\/p> <p> PERSONALIZE WEDDING COOKIE CUTTER W\/CARD (Personilized Free)<\/p> <p> We spent 150.00 for stuff to make 24 Bags. We are also\u00a0doing is ordering lanyards for each sailing guest. OTC has Plain white ones and we are going to write on them the ship name and date.<span  style=\"display: none\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jjwelsh214@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307565021,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240924.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jjwelsh","Id":240924,"Name":"jjwelsh","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6680f560df7b8673996a8847918fa029","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: #4b0082\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We just finished putting ours together.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: #4b0082\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We did it over time and were finally satisfied that eough was enough.&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: #4b0082\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This stuff really does add up, and thankfully we only have 12 sailing guest! lol&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; OOT Bag - 1 per cabin&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"051.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468134\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG00850-20110619-2009.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468136\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; OOT Bag - 1 for each sailing guest&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"014.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468138\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Guest1_a.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468140\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cabin Key Card Holder&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Guest3.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468142\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Guest4.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468144\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1477381,"PostDate":1309185852,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"color: #4b0082\"><strong>We just finished putting ours together.<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: #4b0082\"><strong>We did it over time and were finally satisfied that eough was enough.<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: #4b0082\"><strong>This stuff really does add up, and thankfully we only have 12 sailing guest! lol<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> OOT Bag - 1 per cabin<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"051.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468134\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG00850-20110619-2009.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468136\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> OOT Bag - 1 for each sailing guest<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"014.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468138\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Guest1_a.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468140\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Cabin Key Card Holder<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Guest3.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468142\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Guest4.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/468144\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"det1969@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281880008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231387.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dai69","Id":231387,"Name":"dai69","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"44a41aa493490c124fafa483dcfaa135","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; They turned out great!&amp;nbsp; Your guests will love them.&amp;nbsp; The bags are really cute!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1477808,"PostDate":1309249994,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> They turned out great!\u00a0 Your guests will love them.\u00a0 The bags are really cute!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"andreajphillips@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.56.10.56","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1213791420,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-210029.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":142,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~Andrea~","Id":210029,"Name":"~Andrea~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76f3b55873a0cd7dda8c6c1b15d98e56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Woohoo, I won my Johnson and Johnson first aid kits on eBay.&amp;nbsp; With shipping they came to about 70 cent each.&amp;nbsp; Each one contains 12 items. Now to find some hand sanitizers.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1478016,"PostDate":1309262560,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Woohoo, I won my Johnson and Johnson first aid kits on eBay.\u00a0 With shipping they came to about 70 cent each.\u00a0 Each one contains 12 items. Now to find some hand sanitizers.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"therealallbap@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1308683094,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241425.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"allbap","Id":241425,"Name":"allbap","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a93b4ab1331a4eed073ab057c3cb1c87","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve got to get on the ball. I feel left out great ideas here though!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1479921,"PostDate":1309540517,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've got to get on the ball. I feel left out great ideas here though!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"latishasmith04@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1298753831,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237228.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":166,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"luvfordalo","Id":237228,"Name":"luvfordalo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cfe039132a5f03afc2451b7de0eee28","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Dai69, I love your bags and the contents! I thought I read somewhere (maybe cruise critic?) that you weren&#039;t going to do favors or oot bags, but those are awesome!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am less then 10 months away and I have almost all the stuff for our OOT bags done.. except the sunblocks, I want to make sure they don&#039;t expire.. but I got caught up in oot bag shopping, I have to concentrate on paying on the cruise\/wedding now lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1480202,"PostDate":1309620363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Dai69, I love your bags and the contents! I thought I read somewhere (maybe cruise critic?) that you weren't going to do favors or oot bags, but those are awesome!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am less then 10 months away and I have almost all the stuff for our OOT bags done.. except the sunblocks, I want to make sure they don't expire.. but I got caught up in oot bag shopping, I have to concentrate on paying on the cruise\/wedding now lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>~Married aboard the cruise ship the <\/span><strong>'Carnival Dream'<\/strong><span>~<\/span><br><span>~Carnival Dream Wedding April 28th, 2012, then set sail on a 7 night Caribbean Cruise April 28th-May 5th, 2012~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"symbol_J@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1301233815,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238250.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":154,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DramaticAnnie","Id":238250,"Name":"DramaticAnnie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13cf9fda4c2f4f26631f92994ed03643","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; They look perfect!!! Well done!!! x&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1481026,"PostDate":1309826033,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> They look perfect!!! Well done!!! x<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"t.z.s.86@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1309498310,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241841.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tammy86","Id":241841,"Name":"Tammy86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"333c4cf002340978c7d56b0bc84a023c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Your bags came out so cute!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1482262,"PostDate":1309975938,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Your bags came out so cute!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"briankelliwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1276809246,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229298.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shutterbug","Id":229298,"Name":"shutterbug","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a003842c0ad1f542592c842e65de7c34","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; All the welcome bags look fantastic.&amp;nbsp; Everyone has such wonderful ideas; you&#039;ve all inspired me to&amp;nbsp;include.&amp;nbsp; We were just planning on doing custom logo printed or embroidered canvas tote bags with personalized beach towels, but now I want to add more.&amp;nbsp; I really like the idea of lanyards for room keys\/ID and travel mugs (especially since Disney Cruise Line offers complimentary soda fountains).&amp;nbsp; And about half our group has never cruised before so a&amp;nbsp;survival kit would be handy and useful.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks everyone for inspiring me!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1508645,"PostDate":1313996689,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> All the welcome bags look fantastic.\u00a0 Everyone has such wonderful ideas; you've all inspired me to\u00a0include.\u00a0 We were just planning on doing custom logo printed or embroidered canvas tote bags with personalized beach towels, but now I want to add more.\u00a0 I really like the idea of lanyards for room keys\/ID and travel mugs (especially since Disney Cruise Line offers complimentary soda fountains).\u00a0 And about half our group has never cruised before so a\u00a0survival kit would be handy and useful.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks everyone for inspiring me!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenbear25@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1288332891,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233584.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenbear25","Id":233584,"Name":"jenbear25","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c161f18c42b6286f751b847e52a33cb6","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]DramaticAnnie[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Dai69, I love your bags and the contents! I thought I read somewhere (maybe cruise critic?) that you weren&#039;t going to do favors or oot bags, but those are awesome!! \n \n I am less then 10 months away and I have almost all the stuff for our OOT bags done.. except the sunblocks, I want to make sure they don&#039;t expire.. but I got caught up in oot bag shopping, I have to concentrate on paying on the cruise\/wedding now lol[\/quote] \n \n Hi Annie - \n \n Originally we weren&#039;t going to do the OOT bags since it was an &#039;added&#039; cost, and the favors we just weren&#039;t sure what we wanted to give. As you can see we decided to them and I am happy we did. Guest were surprised and also said how much they liked them.","Attachments":[],"Id":1509171,"PostDate":1314030214,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>DramaticAnnie<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Dai69, I love your bags and the contents! I thought I read somewhere (maybe cruise critic?) that you weren't going to do favors or oot bags, but those are awesome!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am less then 10 months away and I have almost all the stuff for our OOT bags done.. except the sunblocks, I want to make sure they don't expire.. but I got caught up in oot bag shopping, I have to concentrate on paying on the cruise\/wedding now lol<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Hi Annie -<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Originally we weren't going to do the OOT bags since it was an 'added' cost, and the favors we just weren't sure what we wanted to give. As you can see we decided to them and I am happy we did. Guest were surprised and also said how much they liked them.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"det1969@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281880008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231387.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dai69","Id":231387,"Name":"dai69","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":91,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
