Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a9c6b0f3dc9ce9ba141c3f1c843b6cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for all your feedback ladies...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If your not sure if you should do the OOT&amp;nbsp;bags or not&amp;nbsp;but can afford it, I say GO FOR IT!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1509175,"PostDate":1314030381,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for all your feedback ladies...<\/p> <p> If your not sure if you should do the OOT\u00a0bags or not\u00a0but can afford it, I say GO FOR IT!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"det1969@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1281880008,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231387.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dai69","Id":231387,"Name":"dai69","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f75bc969d45376d47fa058e7cc863a2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; How is everyone getting their OOT items and bags to port? Are you shipping them or are you carrying them on a plane?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1542418,"PostDate":1320275817,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> How is everyone getting their OOT items and bags to port? Are you shipping them or are you carrying them on a plane?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kateyesis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1312140337,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243058.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kks2012","Id":243058,"Name":"kks2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39a0b2e7435d4440f1535b96f213c0dd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; My OOT Bags are going to be drawstring backpacks that are beach worthy we will be giving to each cabin.&amp;nbsp; For the Older \"kids\" who are sharing a room, they will all get thier own.They&amp;nbsp;will be decorated with a logo on one side&amp;nbsp;and that family&#039;s&amp;nbsp;last name on the other.&amp;nbsp;All families with same last names will be given different color backpacks.&amp;nbsp;Attached each will have a passport style welcome book with our welcome letter, cabin directory,itineraries ( wedding and optional), Bermuda Map, Fun&amp;nbsp;Facts about Bermuda, Usefull places on the ship.&amp;nbsp;In each have seperate clear plastic bags with wedding line tags:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; In Sickness and in health:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1st aid kit&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Solarcane&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Tylenol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Tums&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sea Sick Meds&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Chapstick&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; In Good Times and Bad:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Room Spray&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Tide to go pen&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Small CLock&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Lint roller&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hairspray&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Highlighter&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For richer or poorer will be a card in the lanyard card holder&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; For as long as we both shall live&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Outlet splitter&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We do have kids coming on the ship with us and anyone under 14  they will each have thier own little baggie of goodies with thier name on it&amp;nbsp;in the family back pack. I&amp;nbsp;am having my MOH ( sister)&amp;nbsp;bring those on board.&amp;nbsp;Oh also on each Passport Welcome&amp;nbsp;booklet&amp;nbsp;the Family name and cabin # will be on the cover so we can distribute them easily once on board. Hope this helps someone out there who is lost on what to do with thier welcome bags. Also for those who are buget conscience, the cost for each bag is under $30 including the bag.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1552014,"PostDate":1322631643,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> My OOT Bags are going to be drawstring backpacks that are beach worthy we will be giving to each cabin.\u00a0 For the Older \"kids\" who are sharing a room, they will all get thier own.They\u00a0will be decorated with a logo on one side\u00a0and that family's\u00a0last name on the other.\u00a0All families with same last names will be given different color backpacks.\u00a0Attached each will have a passport style welcome book with our welcome letter, cabin directory,itineraries ( wedding and optional), Bermuda Map, Fun\u00a0Facts about Bermuda, Usefull places on the ship.\u00a0In each have seperate clear plastic bags with wedding line tags:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> In Sickness and in health:<\/p> <p> 1st aid kit<\/p> <p> Solarcane<\/p> <p> Tylenol<\/p> <p> Tums<\/p> <p> Sea Sick Meds<\/p> <p> Chapstick<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> In Good Times and Bad:<\/p> <p> Room Spray<\/p> <p> Tide to go pen<\/p> <p> Small CLock<\/p> <p> Lint roller<\/p> <p> Hairspray<\/p> <p> Highlighter<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For richer or poorer will be a card in the lanyard card holder<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> For as long as we both shall live<\/p> <p> Outlet splitter<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We do have kids coming on the ship with us and anyone under 14\u00a0\u00a0they will each have thier own little baggie of goodies with thier name on it\u00a0in the family back pack. I\u00a0am having my MOH ( sister)\u00a0bring those on board.\u00a0Oh also on each Passport Welcome\u00a0booklet\u00a0the Family name and cabin # will be on the cover so we can distribute them easily once on board. Hope this helps someone out there who is lost on what to do with thier welcome bags. Also for those who are buget conscience, the cost for each bag is under $30 including the bag.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"c_mcstowe@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1322629502,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248191.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bostoncruiser35","Id":248191,"Name":"bostoncruiser35","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0c2bd9a198a17e6c8edfdcf84cb3fda","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am looking at the reusable grocery tote bags at cheaptotes.com. I know how to screen print and was thinking of printing something on the bags, but I don&#039;t necessarily want them to have to carry around our name and marriage dates. Does anyone have any cute\/quirky cruise quotes\/themes they are using on their oot bag items?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1628316,"PostDate":1338977657,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am looking at the reusable grocery tote bags at cheaptotes.com. I know how to screen print and was thinking of printing something on the bags, but I don't necessarily want them to have to carry around our name and marriage dates. Does anyone have any cute\/quirky cruise quotes\/themes they are using on their oot bag items?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"v.hernandez416@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"129.89.103.188","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338738567,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-256211.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"valh416","Id":256211,"Name":"valh416","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"26f3b3c5fd2ac0b460d9f870709998b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I plan on using a cute picture of an anchor and the saying \"Boat Tote\". I think people will use that more than if the bag had our names on it.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1629459,"PostDate":1339225818,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I plan on using a cute picture of an anchor and the saying \"Boat Tote\". I think people will use that more than if the bag had our names on it.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nat179@bellsouth.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1332398269,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253049.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsEisen","Id":253049,"Name":"FutureMrsEisen","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f9d75ad23cd83bcb13c577d813054c1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve seen lots of people just do the cruise dates and the ship name, or the location&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also depending on your them you could do a play on that like \"Ship&#039;s Ahoy\" or \"Anchors Aweigh\" or \"Feeling Beachy\" etc&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve seen some people roll with a heart theme and do \"love is all you need\" or \"all you need is love\" (might be too girly if you have single guy cruisers)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My fi in all seriousness wants to do Harley + Heather = Awesome.....I am still fighting that battle lol&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1634333,"PostDate":1340405802,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've seen lots of people just do the cruise dates and the ship name, or the location<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also depending on your them you could do a play on that like \"Ship's Ahoy\" or \"Anchors Aweigh\" or \"Feeling Beachy\" etc<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I've seen some people roll with a heart theme and do \"love is all you need\" or \"all you need is love\" (might be too girly if you have single guy cruisers)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My fi in all seriousness wants to do Harley + Heather = Awesome.....I am still fighting that battle lol<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"HarleyandHeather2013@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.230.73.247","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1336945154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255348.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HKdolphingirl","Id":255348,"Name":"HKdolphingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"803bd78bec73421929fb30eaeb047a56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We ended up getting bag from oriental trading and putting an anchor on them. 12 for $15. We shipped them to the hotel where we stayed the night before ship disembarked. It was about $85 to ship 2 boxes of 48 bags ground to the hotel from DC to Orlando.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We had&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1634388,"PostDate":1340443347,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We ended up getting bag from oriental trading and putting an anchor on them. 12 for $15. We shipped them to the hotel where we stayed the night before ship disembarked. It was about $85 to ship 2 boxes of 48 bags ground to the hotel from DC to Orlando.<\/p> <p> We had<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kateyesis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1312140337,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243058.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kks2012","Id":243058,"Name":"kks2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ecd9adfdf9006e8e25f70fdf25eeb7a1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sorry I didn&#039;t mean to send that...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We had&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Wedding Cruise Survival Kit (template from a BDW bride)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ginger powder tea (local Caribbean market)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Advil (minibiz)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; antibacterial and hanger (bath &amp;amp;body works)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; sunblock (target)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; lotion (target)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; tissue (target)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; wisp toothpicks (dollar store)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; aloe vera (target)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Dramamine (minibiz)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Love is Delicious (sweet bag) Saying say: Love is Delicious Your Presence is Sweet From the Mr. &amp;amp; Mrs. Enjoy the Treat&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2 wafer Kitkat (target)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; mini Payday (target)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; mini butterfinger (target)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ringpop (dollar store)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; sourpatch kids (dollar store)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; granola bar (bj&#039;s)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Swedish fish (bjs)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; jolly ranchers (bjs)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; also in the bag&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; chap stick (2 for 3 from big lots)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; deck of cards(2 packs dollar store)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; room key holder&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; water bottle (dollar store)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; first aid kit (dollar store)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here&#039;s the pic&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"OOT bag for my cruise wedding\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873995\/width\/600\/height\/448\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hope this is helpful&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1634402,"PostDate":1340449202,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sorry I didn't mean to send that...<\/p> <p> We had<\/p> <p> Wedding Cruise Survival Kit (template from a BDW bride)<\/p> <p> ginger powder tea (local Caribbean market)<\/p> <p> Advil (minibiz)<\/p> <p> antibacterial and hanger (bath &body works)<\/p> <p> sunblock (target)<\/p> <p> lotion (target)<\/p> <p> tissue (target)<\/p> <p> wisp toothpicks (dollar store)<\/p> <p> aloe vera (target)<\/p> <p> Dramamine (minibiz)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Love is Delicious (sweet bag) Saying say: Love is Delicious Your Presence is Sweet From the Mr. & Mrs. Enjoy the Treat<\/p> <p> 2 wafer Kitkat (target)<\/p> <p> mini Payday (target)<\/p> <p> mini butterfinger (target)<\/p> <p> ringpop (dollar store)<\/p> <p> sourpatch kids (dollar store)<\/p> <p> granola bar (bj's)<\/p> <p> Swedish fish (bjs)<\/p> <p> jolly ranchers (bjs)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> also in the bag<\/p> <p> chap stick (2 for 3 from big lots)<\/p> <p> deck of cards(2 packs dollar store)<\/p> <p> room key holder<\/p> <p> water bottle (dollar store)<\/p> <p> first aid kit (dollar store)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here's the pic<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"OOT bag for my cruise wedding\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873995\/width\/600\/height\/448\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope this is helpful<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kateyesis@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1312140337,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243058.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kks2012","Id":243058,"Name":"kks2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e648b444c489cbb3c4c2e4b80ba15fc1","RawContent":"Did you have any issues with people bringing the snacks on the cruise? for some reason I thought I read somewhere that you couldn&#039;t bring food on board [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kks2012[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sorry I didn&#039;t mean to send that... \n We had \n Wedding Cruise Survival Kit (template from a BDW bride) \n ginger powder tea (local Caribbean market) \n Advil (minibiz) \n antibacterial and hanger (bath &amp;amp;body works) \n sunblock (target) \n lotion (target) \n tissue (target) \n wisp toothpicks (dollar store) \n aloe vera (target) \n Dramamine (minibiz) \n \n Love is Delicious (sweet bag) Saying say: Love is Delicious Your Presence is Sweet From the Mr. &amp;amp; Mrs. Enjoy the Treat \n 2 wafer Kitkat (target) \n mini Payday (target) \n mini butterfinger (target) \n ringpop (dollar store) \n sourpatch kids (dollar store) \n granola bar (bj&#039;s) \n Swedish fish (bjs) \n jolly ranchers (bjs) \n \n also in the bag \n chap stick (2 for 3 from big lots) \n deck of cards(2 packs dollar store) \n room key holder \n water bottle (dollar store) \n first aid kit (dollar store) \n \n Here&#039;s the pic \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873995\/width\/600\/height\/448[\/img] \n \n Hope this is helpful[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1634436,"PostDate":1340471152,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Did you have any issues with people bringing the snacks on the cruise? for some reason I thought I read somewhere that you couldn't bring food on board<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kks2012<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sorry I didn't mean to send that...<\/p> <p> We had<\/p> <p> Wedding Cruise Survival Kit (template from a BDW bride)<\/p> <p> ginger powder tea (local Caribbean market)<\/p> <p> Advil (minibiz)<\/p> <p> antibacterial and hanger (bath &body works)<\/p> <p> sunblock (target)<\/p> <p> lotion (target)<\/p> <p> tissue (target)<\/p> <p> wisp toothpicks (dollar store)<\/p> <p> aloe vera (target)<\/p> <p> Dramamine (minibiz)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Love is Delicious (sweet bag) Saying say: Love is Delicious Your Presence is Sweet From the Mr. & Mrs. Enjoy the Treat<\/p> <p> 2 wafer Kitkat (target)<\/p> <p> mini Payday (target)<\/p> <p> mini butterfinger (target)<\/p> <p> ringpop (dollar store)<\/p> <p> sourpatch kids (dollar store)<\/p> <p> granola bar (bj's)<\/p> <p> Swedish fish (bjs)<\/p> <p> jolly ranchers (bjs)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> also in the bag<\/p> <p> chap stick (2 for 3 from big lots)<\/p> <p> deck of cards(2 packs dollar store)<\/p> <p> room key holder<\/p> <p> water bottle (dollar store)<\/p> <p> first aid kit (dollar store)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here's the pic<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"OOT bag for my cruise wedding\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/873995\/width\/600\/height\/448\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope this is helpful<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"HarleyandHeather2013@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.230.73.247","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1336945154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255348.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HKdolphingirl","Id":255348,"Name":"HKdolphingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1ad35da05fd2e6da809e55f5f7dbe14","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; WOW!!! Those look great!! Thank you for sharing!! What did you use for the anchor, a stencil?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1635124,"PostDate":1340692724,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> WOW!!! Those look great!! Thank you for sharing!! What did you use for the anchor, a stencil?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nat179@bellsouth.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1332398269,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253049.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"FutureMrsEisen","Id":253049,"Name":"FutureMrsEisen","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":91,"TotalPages":10,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":90},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
