Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3070852b57d07130d63cdc1b1f7ec4f6","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"shazam wiki_markup \" id=\"content_1836035\"&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1353006674566_558\"&gt; Carnival allowed me to take a porter cart with the 2 boxes holding my bags upon boarding. The boxes had to fit through the scanners in security. I had designated a person to take care of my favor tables at the reception, so at the end of the reception, they placed the bags on the favor table. I printed names and room numbers on the tags attached to the bags. She handed them out as our guest left the reception.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1353006674566_581\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1353006674566_583\"&gt; Cheryl&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Carnival Paradise&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Wedding - 11.8.12 at Port&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1686468,"PostDate":1352977962,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"shazam wiki_markup \" id=\"content_1836035\"> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1353006674566_558\"> Carnival allowed me to take a porter cart with the 2 boxes holding my bags upon boarding. The boxes had to fit through the scanners in security. I had designated a person to take care of my favor tables at the reception, so at the end of the reception, they placed the bags on the favor table. I printed names and room numbers on the tags attached to the bags. She handed them out as our guest left the reception.<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1353006674566_581\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1353006674566_583\"> Cheryl<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Carnival Paradise<\/p> <p> Wedding - 11.8.12 at Port<\/p> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cheercoach.cheryl@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1327558193,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250521.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":259,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CherylSewell","Id":250521,"Name":"CherylSewell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4867527ad4aee46dab75c24d0f636a4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Oh great good info to know, thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Im hoping to get them to everyones rooms before they get in as a little \"surprise\" but idk if that&#039;s going to happen &lt;span alt=\"???\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1353017756126_785\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1353017756126_784\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I dont want to wait as we&#039;ll be getting married in Cabo&amp;nbsp;a couple of days into the actual cruise.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1686547,"PostDate":1352989062,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Oh great good info to know, thanks!<\/p> <p> Im hoping to get them to everyones rooms before they get in as a little \"surprise\" but idk if that's going to happen <span alt=\"???\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1353017756126_785\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_7_3_1_1353017756126_784\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/huh.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> I dont want to wait as we'll be getting married in Cabo\u00a0a couple of days into the actual cruise.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Melimelvi86@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1332332042,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253020.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Melimelvi86","Id":253020,"Name":"Melimelvi86","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"32a27e13bcbfbb8753a47f183b181dbd","RawContent":"Carnival will deliver your bags for $1 they day after embankment. Take your bags to guest services. Cheryl","Attachments":[],"Id":1686679,"PostDate":1353040347,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                