e,"PostKey":"72237f85d4da8b03e675ce75a38db738","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I saw on your lists free brochures and postcards from vista print...how does that work? How did you get them?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1717499,"PostDate":1360221320,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I saw on your lists free brochures and postcards from vista print...how does that work? How did you get them?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blondi1029@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359814739,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265553.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"blondi1029","Id":265553,"Name":"blondi1029","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a1bd65ec56e7e0fc677e4d247b6381cd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I saw on your lists free brochures and postcards from vista print...how does that work? How did you get them?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1717502,"PostDate":1360221505,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I saw on your lists free brochures and postcards from vista print...how does that work? How did you get them?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blondi1029@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1359814739,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265553.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"blondi1029","Id":265553,"Name":"blondi1029","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":33175,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7b2dbbfd57b0f3791bd97ef51297d038","RawContent":"[quote name=\"blondi1029\"]\n&lt;p&gt; I saw on your lists free brochures and postcards from vista print...how does that work? How did you get them?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;[\/quote] If u google vistaprint free___... like free pens, mugs, postcards, etc. u can find tons free stuff that way. that&#039;s the way I do it n I have gotten a lot that way. Also google vistaprint deals n u can find other message boards with ideas on how 2 get great deals (as well as all the info u can find on here) hope that helps Kara","Attachments":[],"Id":1720218,"PostDate":1360742547,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n            