"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"38bf2f29b0f48ab660cd5c13ad55b77d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;As I have said many times, DJ is the most important, keeping up the people and having great lighting, this will &amp;nbsp;be reflected in your pictures, If you care of course, so I think there are 2 great options in the Riviera Maya, Cancun disco movil and Doremixx, remember this is my opinion and must be good ones or aceptable&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885680,"PostDate":1423412561,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>As I have said many times, DJ is the most important, keeping up the people and having great lighting, this will \u00a0be reflected in your pictures, If you care of course, so I think there are 2 great options in the Riviera Maya, Cancun disco movil and Doremixx, remember this is my opinion and must be good ones or aceptable<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cheers!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Cheers!<\/p>\n<p>Ivan <strong>Luckie Photography<\/strong><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com\">http:\/\/www.luckiephotography.com<\/a><br>\nwedding journalistic, creative portraits and the best underwater photography","Email":"iluckie@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"187.153.177.200","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1302177695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238636.jpg?_r=1389586310","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"IvanLuckiePhotography","Id":238636,"Name":"IvanLuckiePhotography","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"166.137.12.60","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78757,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"253d240e34cf433264f00558278f396a","RawContent":"I guess it depends on 2 things. \n\n\n1.) are you marrying at a place that will allow you to bring in a dj of your choice?\n\n\n2.) a lot of WC have people they are friends with in the business and like to recommend their services.\n\n\nYour doing the right thing by coming on here and asking. It&#039;s good to be thorough.\n\n\nAnd I agree DJ is so important. If it wasn&#039;t for my DJ being so awesome this far I would be worried bc my venues WC quit last month. But I think my dj will keep things moving along come wedding day. Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1885684,"PostDate":1423416239,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I guess it depends on 2 things. <br><br>\n1.) are you marrying at a place that will allow you to bring in a dj of your choice?<br><br>\n2.) a lot of WC have people they are friends with in the business and like to recommend their services.<br><br>\nYour doing the right thing by coming on here and asking. It's good to be thorough.<br><br>\nAnd I agree DJ is so important. If it wasn't for my DJ being so awesome this far I would be worried bc my venues WC quit last month. But I think my dj will keep things moving along come wedding day. Good luck! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisananth@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"166.137.101.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1401107633,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278120.jpg?_r=1421810202","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","Id":278120,"Name":"LisaAnthonyPoppy","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
