d in-room Amenities \u00e2\u20ac\u201c ( for the couple & parents) <\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">Romantic decoration in couple\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s room ( welcome surprise)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">Bottle of International wine will be served in the room upon arrival. (wedding couple)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">Luxury Turn down service. (wedding couple & parents)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">25 professional full digital colored pictures of the wedding ceremony<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">20% Discount on Spa treatments (except pedicure, manicure, hairdresser & makeup)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">Manicure & Pedicure (for the Bride)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">Late Check ( wedding couple & parents, upon request at check in & subject to availability)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">Live Musical Trio (to play at ceremony or dinner)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">Luxury Turn down service. (wedding couple & parents)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">Professional Services of an Onsite Wedding Coordinator.<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">Witnesses ( if required)<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">VIP Treatment for the couple & parents<\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"margin-left:27.0pt;text-align:justify\">\u00b7<span>\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span  style=\"color:#333333\">Special Wedding Present from Bahia Principe ( 3 complimentary nights for your next reservation from may 1<sup>st<\/sup> to December 7<sup>th<\/sup>, 2014 ( minimum stay of 7 nights)<\/span><\/p> <p><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml> <w:WordDocument> <w:View>Normal<\/w:View> <w:Zoom>0<\/w:Zoom> <w:TrackMoves\/> <w:TrackFormatting\/> <w:PunctuationKerning\/> <w:ValidateAgainstSchemas\/> <w:SaveIfXMLInvalid>false<\/w:SaveIfXMLInvalid> <w:IgnoreMixedContent>false<\/w:IgnoreMixedContent> <w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText>false<\/w:AlwaysShowPlaceholderText> <w:DoNotPromoteQF\/> <w:LidThemeOther>EN-US<\/w:LidThemeOther> <w:LidThemeAsian>X-NONE<\/w:LidThemeAsian> <w:LidThemeComplexScript>X-NONE<\/w:LidThemeComplexScript> <w:Compatibility> <w:BreakWrappedTables\/> <w:SnapToGridInCell\/> <w:WrapTextWithPunct\/> <w:UseAsianBreakRules\/> <w:DontGrowAutofit\/> <w:SplitPgBreakAndParaMark\/> <w:EnableOpenTypeKerning\/> <w:DontFlipMirrorIndents\/> <w:OverrideTableStyleHps\/> <\/w:Compatibility> <w:BrowserLevel>MicrosoftInternetExplorer4<\/w:BrowserLevel> <m:mathPr> <m:mathFont m:val=\"Cambria Math\"\/> <m:brkBin m:val=\"before\"\/> <m:brkBinSub m:val=\"&#45;-\"\/> <m:smallFrac m:val=\"off\"\/> <m:dispDef\/> <m:lMargin m:val=\"0\"\/> <m:rMargin m:val=\"0\"\/> <m:defJc m:val=\"centerGroup\"\/> <m:wrapIndent m:val=\"1440\"\/> <m:intLim m:val=\"subSup\"\/> <m:naryLim m:val=\"undOvr\"\/> <\/m:mathPr><\/w:WordDocument> <\/xml><![endif]--><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml> <w:LatentStyles DefLockedState=\"false\" DefUnhideWhenUsed=\"true\" DefSemiHidden=\"true\