22\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Strong\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"20\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"Emphasis\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"59\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Table Grid\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Placeholder Text\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"1\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" QFormat=\"true\" Name=\"No Spacing\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"60\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Light Shading\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"61\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Light List\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"62\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Light Grid\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"63\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium Shading 1\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"64\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium Shading 2\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"65\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium List 1\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"66\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium List 2\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"67\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium Grid 1\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"68\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium Grid 2\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"69\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Medium Grid 3\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"70\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Dark List\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"71\" SemiHidden=\"false\" UnhideWhenUsed=\"false\" Name=\"Colorful Shading\"\/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"72\" Se\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171980900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1394455061,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5112b1e564e07cbd778bf9b7ec786ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WEDDING SITES&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tulum:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gazebo&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Palapa\/Beach Location:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just wanted to add that at this location you get the sunflower arrangements on both sides for free - if you don&#039;t like them, I&#039;m sure you can not have them. They are silk I believe (but I never did get a good look at them).&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Rain Option - Tequila Restaurant:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Akumal Locations:&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Garden:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hammock\/Beach Location:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These next two pictures show you the \"aisle\" you walk down:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is a picture of my wedding decorations (blue) and those similar.&amp;nbsp; As you can see, I brought down additional fabric.&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4390#post_1638299&#039;&gt;Post #4394&lt;\/a&gt; talks about it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514323,"PostDate":1314944077,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong>WEDDING SITES<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Tulum:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Gazebo<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-40764900-1394483687.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo.jpg -  104.39KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-40764900-1394483687.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-09661600-1394483701.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v4.jpg -  97.08KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-09661600-1394483701.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v4.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-37724200-1394483711.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v5.jpg -  104.37KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-37724200-1394483711.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v5.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-27781600-1394482872.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v1.jpg -  100.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-27781600-1394482872.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75137300-1394482883.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v2.jpg -  59.24KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75137300-1394482883.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-42965200-1394482895.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v3.jpg -  73.61KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-42965200-1394482895.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75016200-1394483721.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v6.jpg -  162.15KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75016200-1394483721.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Wedding Gazebo v6.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Palapa\/Beach Location:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-79793200-1394483734.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v4.jpg -  68.68KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-79793200-1394483734.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v4.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-93628100-1394482911.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v1.jpg -  9.32KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-93628100-1394482911.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-95171300-1394482919.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v2.jpg -  23.01KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-95171300-1394482919.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75166900-1394482928.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v3.jpg -  196.5KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-75166900-1394482928.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Beach Wedding v3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just wanted to add that at this location you get the sunflower arrangements on both sides for free - if you don't like them, I'm sure you can not have them. They are silk I believe (but I never did get a good look at them).<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Rain Option - Tequila Restaurant:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-26806300-1394483071.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Rain Wedding Location v1.jpg -  107.81KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-26806300-1394483071.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Rain Wedding Location v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-51703000-1394483095.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Rain Wedding Location v2.jpg -  110.43KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-51703000-1394483095.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Tulum Rain Wedding Location v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Akumal Locations:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Garden:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-12013500-1394483110.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Garden Wedding v1.jpg -  15.22KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-12013500-1394483110.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Garden Wedding v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-95250200-1394483120.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Garden Wedding v2.jpg -  14.33KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-95250200-1394483120.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Garden Wedding v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hammock\/Beach Location:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-99961200-1394483758.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v8.jpg -  89.1KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-99961200-1394483758.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v8.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-30072300-1394483195.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v1.jpg -  58.03KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-30072300-1394483195.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>These next two pictures show you the \"aisle\" you walk down:<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-47352300-1394483207.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v2.jpg -  78.18KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-47352300-1394483207.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-18656600-1394483239.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v3.jpg -  160.83KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-18656600-1394483239.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is a picture of my wedding decorations (blue) and those similar.\u00a0 As you can see, I brought down additional fabric.\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4390#post_1638299' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4394<\/a> talks about it.<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-13049300-1394483354.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v5.jpg -  163.3KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-13049300-1394483354.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v5.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-65617400-1394483363.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v6.jpg -  20.81KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-65617400-1394483363.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v6.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514323]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-25442300-1394483372.jpg\" title=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v7.jpg -  64.82KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-25442300-1394483372.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Gran Bahia Akumal Beach Wedding v7.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"~Trisha~<br \/>\n<a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.faberphotography.com'>www.faberphotography.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\nMy latest destination wedding photos can be found <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/faberphotography.com\/destination-wedding\/'>HERE<\/a>","Email":"tfaber@wbmi.com","IpAddress":"12.24.226.126","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1171980900,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Tlseege","Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":true,"CanDelete":true,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":63282,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1394772977,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0c921762748c880535c7fcf7ce5d9a43","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DINNER OPTIONS&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Menus for all restaurants can be viewed &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bahia-gourmet.com\/en\/losrestaurantes.htm&#039;&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Tulum Dinner Options:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Tequila - Tables of 4, 8, or 10 - white linens&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gran Torguta - Round and square tables (the round ones seat 6, the square seat 4).&amp;nbsp; Can be pushed together to have a table of 10.&amp;nbsp; White table clothes and little vases with flowers in them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Akumal Dinner Options:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Frutos Del Mar (Seafood) - 100 PAX&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Dolce Vita (Italian) - 100 PAX&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Arlequin&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Coba Dinner Options:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mediteraneo - 2 dishes guests can choose from are Linguine Pasta (vegetarian, and everyone thought it was delicious, including me!) and Lemon chicken, which our guests raved about!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Portifino&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2950#post_1313981&#039;&gt;Post #2960&lt;\/a&gt; and &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4410#post_1639879&#039;&gt;Post #4411&lt;\/a&gt; have additional information on the Portifino&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;Pool side dinner options&lt;\/u&gt;: - Round tables of 10&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1410#post_775910&#039;&gt;Post #1414&lt;\/a&gt; contains a video from a Tulum Pool Reception&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These posts have additional information and the last two are Coba specific:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3030#post_1330032&#039;&gt;Post #3031&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3380#post_1475893&#039;&gt;Post #3383&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4220#post_1606339&#039;&gt;Post #4226&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4470#post_1652068&#039;&gt;Post #4478&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Poolside Dinner Pricing&lt;\/strong&gt;:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/50#post_116092&#039;&gt;Post #55&lt;\/a&gt; includes the menus for all options&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;***Note: All the dinners include local drinks inside of the All inclusive program and have a maximum duration of two hours. It will be an extra charge for wine of the wine list and champagne.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Theme Dinners&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt; - Must pay for a minimum of 50 people&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gala Dinner - $72 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;BBQ Dinner - $46 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mexican Dinner - $46 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Caribbean Dinner - $48 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Private Meals&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;\/u&gt;- Must pay for a minimum of 35 people&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Paella (seafood) - $20 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Mixed Grill - $20 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Taquiza (tacos) - $15 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;American (hot dogs &amp;amp; hamburgers) - $12 per person\n\n***All of these meals will be served with disposable cutlery and dishes.&amp;nbsp; (although I had the mixed grill and it was on beautiful white china...)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lobster Dinner\/Special Luxury menu&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At a specialty restaurant - $60 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At a location out of the restaurants - $100 per person&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*** Additional cost for lobster inside the restaurant with the menu of the restaurant 35 USD per order.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Poolside Reception (Cocktails) Only Reception Prices:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Special Cocktails - Sparkling wine, Beer, Margaritas, Pina Colada - $5 per person for the first hour, $3 each additional&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;National Bar - Beer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin&amp;nbsp;- $17 per person for the first hour, $12 each additional&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;International Bar - Beer, Tequila, Rum, Vodka Absolute, Whiskey JW, Chivas, Regal, Cutty Sark, Cocktails, Gin Beef eaters - $24 per person for the first hour, $18 each additional&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Poolside Reception (Cocktails and DJ or Music) Only Reception Prices:&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;These options are for 30 persons maximum, in case there&#039;s more people will have an extra charge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;This packages includes 3 hours of open bar, set up, soft lighting, cocktail tables, Tiffany chairs, microphone, and music. (so this includes DJ).&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;National Bar: &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;Beer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin, Whiskey &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; \t\t\t $1900 USD &lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Special Cocktails:&lt;\/b&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;Beer, PinaColada Cocktail, Margarita Cocktail &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;&amp;amp; Sparkling Wine   $1100 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Cocktails&lt;\/strong&gt; without DJ but with Speakers so we can play our own music: 585 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;50 Persons Poolside Reception&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;National Bar&lt;\/strong&gt;\n\nBeer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin, Whiskey &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; $2680\n\n&lt;b&gt;Special Cocktails&lt;\/b&gt;\n\nBeer, Pina Coladas, Margaritas, Sparkling Wine\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t$1400&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This option &amp;nbsp;is for 50 persons maximum , in case there\u00b4s more people will have an extra charge.\n\nThis packages includes 3 hours of open bar, set up, soft lighting, cocktail tables, white tiffany chairs microphone and music DJ&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;ADDITIONAL SPARKLING WINE OR CHAMPAGNE&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Domestic Sparkling Wine (price per bottle)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;25.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Freixenet (price per bottle)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;39.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Moet Chandon (price per bottle)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;85.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MUSIC&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;Mexican Party with live show and Mariachi - &lt;strong&gt;$2,000 for 1 hour&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Mexican Guitar Duet (set 45 minutes)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$272.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Mexican Guitar Trio (set 45 minutes)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  &amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$295.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Mariachi (set 45 minutes) \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$370.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Saxophonist (set 45 minutes)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  &amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$390.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Marimba (set 45 minutes)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;$325.00 USD&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Live Band (set 45 minutes)&lt;strong&gt;\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  &amp;nbsp; $999.00 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;DJ (set 1 hour, only in private events)\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  &amp;nbsp;   &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;$211.00 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin-left:.75in;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"&gt;Violin \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;$390.00 USD&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;*Private group entertainment (Olympic games, treasure hunt, etc) - $5 per person&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1514324,"PostDate":1314944082,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><u><strong>DINNER OPTIONS<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Menus for all restaurants can be viewed <a href='http:\/\/www.bahia-gourmet.com\/en\/losrestaurantes.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Tulum Dinner Options:<\/u><\/p>\n<p>Tequila - Tables of 4, 8, or 10 - white linens<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-31326400-1394481474.jpg\" title=\"Tequila.jpg -  92.14KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-31326400-1394481474.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Tequila.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Gran Torguta - Round and square tables (the round ones seat 6, the square seat 4).\u00a0 Can be pushed together to have a table of 10.\u00a0 White table clothes and little vases with flowers in them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Akumal Dinner Options:<\/u><\/p>\n<p>Frutos Del Mar (Seafood) - 100 PAX<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-90909000-1394481863.jpg\" title=\"Frutos-Del-Mar-Restaurant-Inside.jpg -  149.11KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-90909000-1394481863.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Frutos-Del-Mar-Restaurant-Inside.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Dolce Vita (Italian) - 100 PAX<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-88739900-1394481490.jpg\" title=\"Dolce Vita v1.jpg -  185.47KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-88739900-1394481490.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Dolce Vita v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-39434500-1394481503.jpg\" title=\"Dolce Vita v2.jpg -  189.26KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-39434500-1394481503.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Dolce Vita v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-42900500-1394481885.jpg\" title=\"Dolce-Vita-Restaurant-Table.jpg -  160.88KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-42900500-1394481885.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Dolce-Vita-Restaurant-Table.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Arlequin<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-33622000-1394481926.jpg\" title=\"Arlequin-Restaurant-Inside.jpg -  122.82KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-33622000-1394481926.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Arlequin-Restaurant-Inside.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Coba Dinner Options:<\/u><\/p>\n<p>Mediteraneo - 2 dishes guests can choose from are Linguine Pasta (vegetarian, and everyone thought it was delicious, including me!) and Lemon chicken, which our guests raved about!<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-85554300-1394481965.jpg\" title=\"Mediterraneo-Restaurant-Inside.jpg -  157.86KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-85554300-1394481965.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Mediterraneo-Restaurant-Inside.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>Portifino<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-78985500-1394481518.jpg\" title=\"Portifino v1.jpg -  21.16KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-78985500-1394481518.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Portifino v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-45697500-1394481989.jpg\" title=\"Portofino-Restaurant-Inside.jpg -  163.86KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-45697500-1394481989.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Portofino-Restaurant-Inside.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/2950#post_1313981' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #2960<\/a> and <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4410#post_1639879' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4411<\/a> have additional information on the Portifino<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u>Pool side dinner options<\/u>: - Round tables of 10<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-69637500-1394481534.jpg\" title=\"Poolside Reception v1.jpg -  27.2KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-69637500-1394481534.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Poolside Reception v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-60785500-1394481545.jpg\" title=\"Poolside Reception v2.jpg -  18.04KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-60785500-1394481545.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Poolside Reception v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-70749100-1394481558.jpg\" title=\"Poolside Reception v3.jpg -  44.64KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-70749100-1394481558.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Poolside Reception v3.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-58660100-1394481580.jpg\" title=\"Riviera-Maya-Destination-Wedding-Photographer-Faber-Photography-v5.jpg -  109.86KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-58660100-1394481580.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Riviera-Maya-Destination-Wedding-Photographer-Faber-Photography-v5.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-21364800-1394482024.jpg\" title=\"Coba-Jacuzzi-Pool-Wedding-Setup-2.jpg -  159.96KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-21364800-1394482024.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Coba-Jacuzzi-Pool-Wedding-Setup-2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-38359000-1394482229.jpg\" title=\"Coba Poolside Reception v1.jpg -  115.97KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-38359000-1394482229.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Coba Poolside Reception v1.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-04630900-1394482243.jpg\" title=\"Coba Poolside Reception v2.jpg -  127.66KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-04630900-1394482243.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Coba Poolside Reception v2.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1514324]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-37237300-1394482254.jpg\" title=\"Tulum Poolside Reception.jpg -  128.24KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-207201-0-37237300-1394482254.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Tulum Poolside Reception.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/1410#post_775910' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #1414<\/a> contains a video from a Tulum Pool Reception<\/p>\n<p>These posts have additional information and the last two are Coba specific:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3030#post_1330032' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #3031<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/3380#post_1475893' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #3383<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4220#post_1606339' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4226<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/4470#post_1652068' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #4478<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Poolside Dinner Pricing<\/strong>:<\/u><\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/786\/gran-bahia-principe-akumal-tulum-coba-post-here\/50#post_116092' class='bbc_url' title=''>Post #55<\/a> includes the menus for all options<\/p>\n<p>***Note: All the dinners include local drinks inside of the All inclusive program and have a maximum duration of two hours. It will be an extra charge for wine of the wine list and champagne.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Theme Dinners<\/strong><\/u> - Must pay for a minimum of 50 people<\/p>\n<p>Gala Dinner - $72 per person<\/p>\n<p>BBQ Dinner - $46 per person<\/p>\n<p>Mexican Dinner - $46 per person<\/p>\n<p>Caribbean Dinner - $48 per person<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Additional Private Meals<\/strong> <\/u>- Must pay for a minimum of 35 people<\/p>\n<p>Paella (seafood) - $20 per person<\/p>\n<p>Mixed Grill - $20 per person<\/p>\n<p>Taquiza (tacos) - $15 per person<\/p>\n<p>American (hot dogs & hamburgers) - $12 per person<br>\n***All of these meals will be served with disposable cutlery and dishes.\u00a0 (although I had the mixed grill and it was on beautiful white china...)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Lobster Dinner\/Special Luxury menu<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>At a specialty restaurant - $60 per person<\/p>\n<p>At a location out of the restaurants - $100 per person<\/p>\n<p>*** Additional cost for lobster inside the restaurant with the menu of the restaurant 35 USD per order.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>Poolside Reception (Cocktails) Only Reception Prices:<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Special Cocktails - Sparkling wine, Beer, Margaritas, Pina Colada - $5 per person for the first hour, $3 each additional<\/p>\n<p>National Bar - Beer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin\u00a0- $17 per person for the first hour, $12 each additional<\/p>\n<p>International Bar - Beer, Tequila, Rum, Vodka Absolute, Whiskey JW, Chivas, Regal, Cutty Sark, Cocktails, Gin Beef eaters - $24 per person for the first hour, $18 each additional<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u>Poolside Reception (Cocktails and DJ or Music) Only Reception Prices:<\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">These options are for 30 persons maximum, in case there's more people will have an extra charge.\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">This packages includes 3 hours of open bar, set up, soft lighting, cocktail tables, Tiffany chairs, microphone, and music. (so this includes DJ).<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><b>National Bar: \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<\/b><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Beer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin, Whiskey \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 $1900 USD <\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><b>Special Cocktails:<\/b><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">Beer, PinaColada Cocktail, Margarita Cocktail <\/span><span  style=\"font-family:Tahoma;color:rgb(34,34,34)\">& Sparkling Wine\u00a0\u00a0 $1100 USD<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><br><span  style=\"font-family:sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34)\"><strong>Special Cocktails<\/strong> without DJ but with Speakers so we can play our own music: 585 USD<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>50 Persons Poolside Reception<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p><strong>National Bar<\/strong><br>\nBeer, Rum, Vodka, Tequila, Cocktails, Gin, Whiskey \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 $2680<br><br><b>Special Cocktails<\/b><br>\nBeer, Pina Coladas, Margaritas, Sparkling Wine\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0$1400<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This option \u00a0is for 50 persons maximum , in case there\u00b4s more people will have an extra charge.<br>\nThis packages includes 3 hours of open bar, set up, soft lighting, cocktail tables, white tiffany chairs microphone and music DJ<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><u><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">ADDITIONAL SPARKLING WINE OR CHAMPAGNE<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Domestic Sparkling Wine (price per bottle)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">25.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Freixenet (price per bottle)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">39.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Moet Chandon (price per bottle)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">85.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>MUSIC<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.75in\">Mexican Party with live show and Mariachi - <strong>$2,000 for 1 hour<\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.75in\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Mexican Guitar Duet (set 45 minutes)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$272.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.75in\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Mexican Guitar Trio (set 45 minutes)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$295.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.75in\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Mariachi (set 45 minutes) \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$370.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.75in\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Saxophonist (set 45 minutes)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$390.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.75in\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Marimba (set 45 minutes)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">$325.00 USD<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin-left:.75in\"><span  style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size:11pt\">Live Band (set 45 minutes)<strong>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00